"id":8,"type":"VAEDecode","pos":[123.43773438366703,88.08993423266607],"size":[210,46],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"samples","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":7},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":8}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"IMAGE","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","slot_index":0,"links":[22,23]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VAEDecode"},"widgets_values":[],"color":"#233","bgcolor":"#355"},{"id":12,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-2308.5222101154454,-1.8385419756297097],"size":[522.6546395156367,635.7349751713937],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["# ZMongo Save Image Demo\n\n## Purpose\nThis workflow demonstrates the complete save-and-verify loop:\n\n1. Generate an image in ComfyUI.\n2. Save the image into a ZMongo-compatible document.\n3. Return the new `document_id`.\n4. Immediately load the saved image back from the same document.\n5. Preview/save the verified image locally.\n\n## Required settings\n- `00 Local File Store Session` is used by default. It stores JSON/image data locally inside the ComfyUI-ZMongo plugin folder.\n- `Collection Name` is set to `images`.\n- `field_path` is set to `image_data`.\n- Leave `document_id` blank on the save node to create a new document.\n- The save node outputs the new `document_id`, which is already connected to the display node.\n\n## Recommended use\n- Run the workflow once.\n- Open the `JSON Result` preview.\n- Confirm that `success` is true and that a `document_id` was returned.\n- The `Verify by Loading Image Back from ZMongo` node should display the saved image.\n- Use `Save Document Value` or related document nodes later to add metadata, tags, review notes, or workflow status.\n\n## Important\nThe optional `Load Image` node is left in the workflow only as an alternate source. The active save path uses the generated image from `VAEDecode`, not the uploaded image node.\n\nTo save an uploaded image instead, disconnect the image input on `Save Generated Image to ZMongo` and connect the `Load Image` output to it.\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":4,"type":"CheckpointLoaderSimple","pos":[-729.7605810460207,-54.176710054443326],"size":[315,98],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"ckpt_name","name":"ckpt_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"ckpt_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","slot_index":0,"links":[1]},{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP","slot_index":1,"links":[3,5]},{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"VAE","type":"VAE","slot_index":2,"links":[8]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CheckpointLoaderSimple"},"widgets_values":["v1-5-pruned-emaonly-fp16.safetensors"],"color":"#233","bgcolor":"#355"},{"id":17,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":[149.67270752819846,402.0182698039551],"size":[248.6500244140625,258],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":22}],"outputs":[],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PreviewImage"},"widgets_values":[],"color":"#233","bgcolor":"#355"},{"id":20,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[597.2311104959418,-134.00445211749576],"size":[430,260],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Save Node Instructions","properties":{},"widgets_values":["# Save Node Notes\n\n- `collection_name`: usually `images`.\n- `field_path`: use `image_data`.\n- `filename`: display name stored with the image.\n- `document_id`: leave blank to create a new record.\n- `doc_key`: optional stable key for demos or repeatable saves.\n- `metadata_json`: must be valid JSON.\n\nThe save node returns:\n- `json`\n- `document_id`\n- `field_path`\n- `refresh`\n- `created_new_document`\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":10,"type":"ZMongoApiEasySaveImageNode","pos":[590.4292916482865,196.44056131023834],"size":[430,330],"flags":{},"order":18,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"session","name":"session"